    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44876" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπρόσ-οδος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		of persons, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>accessible</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.57
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ages.</u>
				9.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Publ.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of places,
				<i>easily accessible</i>, in 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
